lec06kp04-u01-p4-nf-lec06-kp04-p4-39.text:
Common error: reading $w[t-\tau]$ as $w[\tau-t]$
and sliding the kernel as it is;
that computes cross-correlation.

lec06kp04-u01-p13-nf-lec06-kp04-p13-53.text:
Commutativity: swapping the two operands
keeps the result. Convolution has $x\ast w=w\ast x$;
cross-correlation in general does not.
